{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-content-localization","title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/dynamic-content-localization","wordCount":1320,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态内容本地化\">动态内容本地化</h1><p>静态 UI 文案可以预先翻译并打包部署，但后端系统中存在大量运行时生成的动态内容——用户提交的评论、搜索结果摘要、通知模板、AI 生成的文本。这些内容无法走传统的 TMS 预翻译流程，需要不同的本地化策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>内容分类决策</strong>：按内容类型选策略——模板化消息用预翻译+插值，UGC 用按需 MT，CMS 走人工翻译管道</li>\n<li><strong>异步翻译架构</strong>：UGC 翻译不阻塞写入路径，后台队列异步处理后存入翻译表</li>\n<li><strong>行式多语言模型</strong>：独立翻译表（<code>content_id + locale</code> 联合主键）是 CMS schema 稳定扩展的推荐方案</li>\n<li><strong>邮件/通知本地化</strong>：使用用户 profile 存储的 locale，格式化函数必须显式传入 locale 参数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"动态内容的分类与策略选择\">动态内容的分类与策略选择</h2><p>并非所有动态内容都需要翻译。策略选择取决于内容类型和业务需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>翻译策略</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统通知模板</td>\n<td>预翻译模板 + 运行时变量插值</td>\n<td>&quot;您的订单 {orderId} 已发货&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户生成内容 (UGC)</td>\n<td>按需机器翻译 / 不翻译</td>\n<td>商品评论、论坛帖子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMS 文章</td>\n<td>人工翻译 + 发布管道</td>\n<td>帮助文档、营销页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索结果片段</td>\n<td>索引时翻译 / 多语言索引</td>\n<td>产品描述 snippet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误消息</td>\n<td>预翻译 + 参数化</td>\n<td>&quot;文件 {name} 超过 {limit}MB&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 生成文本</td>\n<td>指定输出语言 / 后翻译</td>\n<td>推荐理由、摘要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Dynamic Content] --&gt; B{Content type?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Template-based| C[Pre-translated template&lt;br/&gt;+ runtime interpolation]&#10;    B --&gt;|User generated| D{Translation needed?}&#10;    B --&gt;|CMS managed| E[Human translation&lt;br/&gt;via TMS workflow]&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| F[On-demand MT&lt;br/&gt;+ quality gate]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| G[Serve original&lt;br/&gt;with language tag]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Localized Output]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[Dynamic Content] --&gt; B{Content type?}\n    B --&gt;|Template-based| C[Pre-translated template&lt;br/&gt;+ runtime interpolation]\n    B --&gt;|User generated| D{Translation needed?}\n    B --&gt;|CMS managed| E[Human translation&lt;br/&gt;via TMS workflow]\n    D --&gt;|Yes| F[On-demand MT&lt;br/&gt;+ quality gate]\n    D --&gt;|No| G[Serve original&lt;br/&gt;with language tag]\n    C --&gt; H[Localized Output]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"模板化消息与变量插值\">模板化消息与变量插值</h2><p>后端消息模板是最常见的动态本地化形式。核心原则：<strong>把可变部分参数化，只翻译固定骨架</strong>。</p>\n<p>传统 ICU MessageFormat 1 的模板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{userName} added {count, plural,&#10;  one {one item}&#10;  other {{count} items}&#10;} to their cart.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{userName} added {count, plural,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  one {one item}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  other {{count} items}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} to their cart.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MessageFormat 2.0（2025 年 3 月 Final Candidate）引入了更清晰的声明式语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\".input {$userName :string}&#10;.input {$count :integer}&#10;.match $count&#10;  one  {{{$userName} added one item to their cart.}}&#10;  *    {{{$userName} added {$count} items to their cart.}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.input {$userName :string}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.input {$count :integer}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.match $count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  one  {{{$userName} added one item to their cart.}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  *    {{{$userName} added {$count} items to their cart.}}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MF2 的关键改进在于变量声明与匹配逻辑的分离——翻译者能清楚看到哪些是变量、哪些是选择分支。但截至 2026 年中，MF2 在主流翻译平台和框架中的采用仍处于早期阶段。</p>\n<p><strong>模板中变量的排序问题</strong>：不同语言的语法结构要求变量出现在不同位置。英语 <code>&quot;{name} liked your photo&quot;</code> 在日语中变为 <code>&quot;{name}があなたの写真にいいねしました&quot;</code>——主语位置从句首移到了动词前。模板必须允许翻译者自由重排变量位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ugc-的按需翻译架构\">UGC 的按需翻译架构</h2><p>用户生成内容的翻译不能阻塞请求路径。典型的异步翻译架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as User A (writes in ja)&#10;    participant API as Backend API&#10;    participant DB as Database&#10;    participant Q as Translation Queue&#10;    participant MT as MT Engine&#10;    participant U2 as User B (reads in en)&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;API: POST review (Japanese)&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Store original + lang tag&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;Q: Enqueue translation job&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;U: 201 Created&#10;&#10;    Q-&gt;&gt;MT: Translate ja → en, zh, ko&#10;    MT--&gt;&gt;Q: Translated texts&#10;    Q-&gt;&gt;DB: Store translations&#10;&#10;    U2-&gt;&gt;API: GET review (Accept-Language: en)&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Query translation&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;API: English translation&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;U2: Translated review\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User A (writes in ja)\n    participant API as Backend API\n    participant DB as Database\n    participant Q as Translation Queue\n    participant MT as MT Engine\n    participant U2 as User B (reads in en)\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;API: POST review (Japanese)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Store original + lang tag\n    API-&gt;&gt;Q: Enqueue translation job\n    API--&gt;&gt;U: 201 Created\n\n    Q-&gt;&gt;MT: Translate ja → en, zh, ko\n    MT--&gt;&gt;Q: Translated texts\n    Q-&gt;&gt;DB: Store translations\n\n    U2-&gt;&gt;API: GET review (Accept-Language: en)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Query translation\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: English translation\n    API--&gt;&gt;U2: Translated review</pre><p>设计决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>选项 A</th>\n<th>选项 B</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻译时机</td>\n<td>写入时全量翻译</td>\n<td>首次请求时按需翻译</td>\n<td>高频内容写入时；低频内容按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未翻译时行为</td>\n<td>显示原文 + 语言标签</td>\n<td>实时 MT fallback</td>\n<td>显示原文 + &quot;翻译中&quot;标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻译存储</td>\n<td>同表多列</td>\n<td>独立翻译表</td>\n<td>独立表（schema 不随 locale 膨胀）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MT 质量不达标</td>\n<td>显示 MT 结果 + 标记</td>\n<td>隐藏该内容</td>\n<td>显示 + 标记&quot;机器翻译&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>独立翻译表的 schema 设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE content_translations (&#10;  content_id   BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  content_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,  -- &#39;review&#39;, &#39;comment&#39;, &#39;post&#39;&#10;  locale       VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL,  -- &#39;en&#39;, &#39;zh-Hans&#39;, &#39;ko&#39;&#10;  translated   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  source       VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,  -- &#39;human&#39;, &#39;mt_google&#39;, &#39;mt_deepl&#39;&#10;  confidence   REAL,                  -- MT 置信度 [0, 1]&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (content_id, content_type, locale)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content_translations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'review', 'comment', 'post'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'en', 'zh-Hans', 'ko'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  translated   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'human', 'mt_google', 'mt_deepl'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MT 置信度 [0, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (content_id, content_type, locale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cms-多语言内容模型\">CMS 多语言内容模型</h2><p>CMS 后端的多语言数据模型有三种主流架构：</p>\n<p><strong>方案 1：列式（Column-per-locale）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE articles (&#10;  id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  title_en TEXT, title_ja TEXT, title_zh TEXT,&#10;  body_en TEXT, body_ja TEXT, body_zh TEXT&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> articles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title_en </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, title_ja </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, title_zh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body_en </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body_ja </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body_zh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>问题：每新增一个 locale 就要改 schema；列数爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>方案 2：行式（Row-per-locale）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE article_translations (&#10;  article_id BIGINT REFERENCES articles(id),&#10;  locale VARCHAR(10),&#10;  title TEXT,&#10;  body TEXT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (article_id, locale)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> article_translations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  article_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (article_id, locale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：schema 稳定、locale 数量无限扩展。这是推荐方案。</p>\n<p><strong>方案 3：JSON 列</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE articles (&#10;  id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  translations JSONB  -- {&quot;en&quot;: {&quot;title&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;...&quot;}, &quot;ja&quot;: {...}}&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> articles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  translations JSONB  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"en\": {\"title\": \"...\", \"body\": \"...\"}, \"ja\": {...}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适合小规模或 NoSQL 系统；大规模下索引和查询效率不如行式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"邮件与通知的本地化\">邮件与通知的本地化</h2><p>后端发送的邮件和推送通知是最常被遗漏的本地化场景。特殊挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>邮件 HTML 渲染环境不可控（各邮件客户端渲染引擎不同）</li>\n<li>推送通知有字符限制（iOS: ~178 字符, Android: ~65 字符标题）</li>\n<li>发送时用户不在线，无法动态切换语言——必须使用用户 profile 中存储的 locale</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 后端邮件发送的 locale 选择逻辑&#10;async function sendOrderConfirmation(userId: string, orderId: string) {&#10;  const user = await userService.getById(userId);&#10;  const locale = user.preferredLocale ?? &#39;en&#39;;&#10;&#10;  const template = await templateService.get(&#39;order_confirmation&#39;, locale);&#10;  const order = await orderService.getById(orderId);&#10;&#10;  const rendered = templateEngine.render(template, {&#10;    userName: user.displayName,&#10;    orderId: order.id,&#10;    total: formatCurrency(order.total, order.currency, locale),&#10;    estimatedDelivery: formatDate(order.estimatedDelivery, locale),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  await emailService.send({&#10;    to: user.email,&#10;    subject: rendered.subject,&#10;    html: rendered.body,&#10;    headers: { &#39;Content-Language&#39;: locale },&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后端邮件发送的 locale 选择逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendOrderConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.preferredLocale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'en'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> templateService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_confirmation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, locale);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rendered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> templateEngine.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(template, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userName: user.displayName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orderId: order.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.total, order.currency, locale),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    estimatedDelivery: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.estimatedDelivery, locale),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emailService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    to: user.email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subject: rendered.subject,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    html: rendered.body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Language'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: locale },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键点：<code>formatCurrency</code> 和 <code>formatDate</code> 在后端调用时必须指定 locale 参数——不能依赖系统默认 locale，因为邮件服务器的 locale 设置与收件人无关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"翻译版本与回滚\">翻译版本与回滚</h2><p>翻译内容也需要版本管理。生产事故场景：翻译者误将英语翻译覆盖了日语、或 MT 产出了不当内容。</p>\n<p>翻译版本化策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不可变版本</strong>：每次翻译更新创建新版本，旧版本保留。回滚 = 指向旧版本</li>\n<li><strong>与代码版本绑定</strong>：翻译资源随代码 tag 发布，回滚代码同时回滚翻译</li>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试</strong>：同一 key 多个翻译变体，按实验分组投放</li>\n</ol>\n<p>翻译管道中的质量自动化检查见<a href=\"../operations/i18n-testing-automation\">国际化测试与自动化</a>。对于涉及复数规则和语法变化的复杂消息格式设计，参见<a href=\"pluralization-gender-grammar\">复数化与语法适配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>动态内容本地化的核心策略是按内容类型分治：模板消息预翻译+运行时插值、UGC 异步机器翻译+人工审校、CMS 内容走独立翻译表的行式模型。邮件和通知是最容易被遗漏的本地化场景——后端格式化必须显式传入 locale 而非依赖系统默认值。翻译版本化为误翻译和 MT 质量问题提供了安全回滚能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态内容本地化","id":"动态内容本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动态内容的分类与策略选择","id":"动态内容的分类与策略选择"},{"level":2,"text":"模板化消息与变量插值","id":"模板化消息与变量插值"},{"level":2,"text":"UGC 的按需翻译架构","id":"ugc-的按需翻译架构"},{"level":2,"text":"CMS 多语言内容模型","id":"cms-多语言内容模型"},{"level":2,"text":"邮件与通知的本地化","id":"邮件与通知的本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"翻译版本与回滚","id":"翻译版本与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"翻译管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/translation-management-systems"},"next":{"title":"复数化与语法适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/pluralization-gender-grammar"}}